#chip mega328p, 16

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): The original GATE FIX example on mega328p. This chip has no TMR1IF bit; its Timer1 overflow flag is TOV1 (an AVR flag is cleared by writing 1).
'Expect: compiles, and the Repeat For construct runs exactly the requested 790,047 microseconds worth of clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim Overflows As Byte
Repeat For 790047 us
    Wait 1009 us
    If TOV1 = 1 Then
        Overflows = Overflows + 1
        TOV1 = 1
    End If
End Repeat
Do
Loop
